  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;The proposal, by virtue of failure to\r\ndemonstrate sufficient built-in storage space and the absence of a proposed section\r\ndrawing detailing the internal head heights of the unit, the\r\nproposal has failed to demonstrate that the unit would provide an overall\r\nacceptable standard of living accommodation. The proposed development would\r\ntherefore give rise to substandard and poor quality accommodation to the\r\ndetriment of the residential amenities of the existing and future occupiers of\r\nthe unit, contrary to policies DM1 C, DM1 D (g), DM26 A (a), and (c), and DM26\r\nE of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
